- you can't just change some setting or option and have it work in the
"real" Nethack
- as far as i know, you can't download a program that would change the
"real" nethack to add this feature (e.g. binary patch)

the only way i know of to get this feature is to:

1. play online at a site that has the patch (nethack.alt.org)
2. download the source code for nethack, apply the hpmon / status
colors patch and compile it yourself
3. have somebody do #2 for you, and then provide you with the
executable

